                  "line": 5,
                  "heading": "Aircraft Overview: Airbus A380"
                },
                "text": "The Airbus A380 is the world’s largest passenger airliner, renowned for its double-deck, wide-body design, offering unmatched space, comfort, and quietness in long-haul travel. With its advanced aerodynamics and efficient engines, the A380 is a flagship for many leading airlines, optimizing both capacity and passenger experience."
              }
